    :toughnessValue "4"^^xsd:integer ;
    :hasKeywordAbility :Ward ;
    :printedText """Ward—{2}, Pay 2 life.
Skeletons and Zombies you control get +1/+1 and have menace.
Whenever you commit a crime, create two tapped 2/2 blue and black Zombie Rogue creature tokens. This ability triggers only once each turn. (Targeting opponents, anything they control, and/or cards in their graveyards is a crime.)"""@en ;
    :oracleText """Ward—{2}, Pay 2 life.
Skeletons and Zombies you control get +1/+1 and have menace.
Whenever you commit a crime, create two tapped 2/2 blue and black Zombie Rogue creature tokens. This ability triggers only once each turn. (Targeting opponents, anything they control, and/or cards in their graveyards is a crime.)"""@en ;
    :gathererUrl "https://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=655030"^^xsd:anyURI ;
